{
  "slug": "coremem",
  "name": "Coremem",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "CoreMem gives Claude persistent memory across every session. Your preferences, project context, and working style live in mems — structured notes you write and control. Claude can search and load relevant mems automatically as you work, and propose updates when it learns something new.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install coremem@claude-community` from `corememapp/claude-plugin`.\n\nA Claude Code plugin that connects your mems to your coding sessions. Claude loads relevant context automatically, and you can propose updates back to your mem store without leaving the editor.",
